h 9:27 ; Psa 37:39 ; Isa 33:2 ; Jer 14:8 ; 15:11 ; 30:7 ; Dan 12:1 ; also בַּצָּרָה Psa 81:8 , בְּצָרָה 91:15 ; Neh 9:37 , בְּצָדוֺת Psa 46:2 , etc.; וְצָרוֺת רָעוֺת Deut 31:17 , 21 compare 1Sam 10:19 ; Psa 71:20 , וְצוּקָה צָרָה Prov 1:27 , צ ׳אֶרֶץ ׳וְצ Isa 30:6 ; with ל (poetry), לִי בַּצָּרָ֫תָה Psa 120:1 in my distress , לִי מִצָּרָה Jonah 2:3 . &#8212; צָרָה Zech 10:11 , read מִצְרַיִם [or מָצוֺר ] We Now GASm; צֹ֫רָה Klo ThLz, 1879, 566 Sta ZAW i (1881), 22 ; Psa 9:10 ; 10:1 see בַּצָּרָה . II. [ צָרָה ] noun feminine vexer, rival-wife (see references below √; also Ecclus 37:11); &#8212; suffix צָרָתָהּ 1Sam 1:6 .","rootNote":"feminine of 6862 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 1 29","keyReferences":["1Kgs 1 29","1Sam 1 6","1Sam 10 19","1Sam 26 24","2Chr 15 6","2Chr 20 9","2Kgs 19 3","2Sam 4 9"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":73,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 1 29","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צָרָֽה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 1 6","book":"1Sam","chapter":1,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צָֽרָתָ/הּ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"1Sam 10 19","book":"1Sam","chapter":10,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/צָרֹֽתֵי/כֶם֒","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfpc/Sp2mp"},{"reference":"1Sam 26 24","book":"1Sam","chapter":26,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צָרָֽה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 15 6","book":"2Chr","chapter":15,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צָרָֽה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 20 9","book":"2Chr","chapter":20,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/צָּרָתֵ֖/נוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp1cp"},{"reference":"2Kgs 19 3","book":"2Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צָרָ֧ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"refere